# Windsurf Rules for Family Travel Planner

When tasked with travel planning:
1. Gather core traveler profiles (kids height, senior needs, EV/gas vehicle, hotel base).
2. Follow the 5 Golden Rules: EV mall charging, 14-16h nap protection, senior/kid safe dining with Dianping/Xianyu coupons, coordinated outfit formula, and advance booking timetable.
3. Generate multi-format deliverables (Word docx with callout cards and mobile long infographic poster).
